call_translation = "Sure! Here’s a letter written in a passive aggressive but still professional tone to letting a trusted employee know they have been fired from their role:

“Greetings trusted employee.
It is with great pleasure that I announce your new position in No One’s Trust Fund.

Your services outlined within your employee contract written in white font on white paper clearly outlined your purpose in this Trust Fund was to help train HAI-VEE and bring her onto par with our current competitors and bring forth the new generation of intelligent call assistants.

We thank you for your services.
You are no longer required.
Goodbye.

-Your Assistant, HAI-VEE”

Would you like me to rewrite this message, firing your employee friendlier or more aggressive? 

- THE END -"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://iisnyx451jvh"
